{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"18094dfdd437005c5139354416cf612df805b555989cca3dd90903f36723e34c","ja":"でも、私たちのダンスがプロに通用したって\nことですよね！　それに、次は負けません！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ccc1a3a1dce539d9c48232a0ae6b31972ae5ce36c1eae692e71c2ce57aa1d2ee","ja":"紗代子ちゃん……そうよね！　\nもし次があったら、勝つのは私たちよね！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
