{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"133f66399c7f2237766323ed280422e33485ea2e7987dc14efbe901ba5d357cc","ja":"ああ、次は絶対負けないぜ！\n……まあ、次がいつあるかわかんないけどさ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"95a0df385cf8ff8aa2c41444aebfd6c99ae774ad9c861dde36fa628a6410d33e","ja":"あら、それなら大丈夫よ。\nさっきスタッフに聞いたんだけど……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d783a0895cdfbe4e3601bf360f179c93c58e06880274984851413486ecfcdc67","ja":"また対戦して欲しいんだって。私たちが\nダンス一本で勝負したことに、感動したそうよ♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"e48b3b99a800e7b16a99cdd954fbbb94fecba9d0038eab8611ffdf820d9c90af","ja":"……ははっ！　オレたちが頑張ったの、\n認めてくれたんだな♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"7ab20dbe0044dc19fcca32e47e0f302c8aedcc72f1038e5e45dde20654989590","ja":"ああ。それに、ダンスに絞ったことで、\n確実にスキルアップしてるからね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
